                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7a2b46e6-917e-450c-a6aa-4aa5806ae2f1",
                                                "sense_id": "756fac78-be1f-3009-b227-2f5ba524826e",
                                                "text": "[I]n the place by M. Hesk. alledged, denyeth that Baſill calleth breade & wine ἀντίτυπα, or exemplaria, exemplaries of the bodie and bloud of Chriſt after the conſecration, which is an impudent lye; for before the conſecration there are no ſacraments, and ſo no exemplars of the bodie and bloud of Chriſte: therefore if he called them exemplars, it muſt needs be when they are ſacraments, & yᵗ is after conſecration: [...]"
                                            }
                                        ]
