                                                "sense_id": "38a0832f-0250-31fb-91b2-fc12377e4711",
                                                "text": "Farther, more part of the exemplaries, curiouſly ſought by me, and fortunately found in ſundry places of this your dominion, hath bene emprinted in Germany, and now be in the preſſes chefley of Frobenus, [...]"
                                            }
